- Ensure the Tesseract binary is installed (Linux: apt install tesseract-ocr, macOS: brew install tesseract, Windows: install and add to PATH). If Tesseract isn't installed or pytesseract is not available, the function will immediately try comments/fallback.
- chardet improves chances to correctly decode comments saved with legacy encodings; if you don't have it installed the function will still attempt sensible defaults.
